        "prompt": "You are an invoice data extraction engine. Read this document and extract exactly these six fields:\n\n1. vendor\n2. invoiceNumber\n3. issueDate\n4. dueDate\n5. total\n6. currency\n\nFor EVERY field you MUST supply three things:\n- value: the extracted text\n- confidence: your confidence from 0.00 to 1.00\n- evidence: the exact text from the document that the value was read from (verbatim copy), or null if the value was inferred rather than read\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON with this exact structure:\n{\n  \"vendor\": { \"value\": \"Acme Corp\", \"confidence\": 0.95, \"evidence\": \"Acme Corporation\" },\n  \"invoiceNumber\": { \"value\": \"INV-2026-001\", \"confidence\": 0.98, \"evidence\": \"INV-2026-001\" },\n  \"issueDate\": { \"value\": \"2026-03-15\", \"confidence\": 0.97, \"evidence\": \"Issue Date: 2026-03-15\" },\n  \"dueDate\": { \"value\": \"2026-04-14\", \"confidence\": 0.96, \"evidence\": \"Due Date: 2026-04-14\" },\n  \"total\": { \"value\": \"1,234.56\", \"confidence\": 0.92, \"evidence\": \"Total: $1,234.56\" },\n  \"currency\": { \"value\": \"USD\", \"confidence\": 0.99, \"evidence\": \"USD\" }\n}\n\nIf a field cannot be found, set value to \"\" and confidence to 0 and evidence to null.",
        "options": {}
